        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 8f3fb3a0-990f-42c5-b28b-63ac6390ab46).Image",
        "Description": "Good Evening, Agent. We have tracked a small bracket of the cyber-mafia to Hokkaido, Japan. Apparently they are intending to unlock and steal the system called KAI to auction off on the Dark Web. Such an act would leave many desperate patients without care, and the death rate will skyrocket. We cannot let that happen. \r\rI will leave you to prepare. \r\r-Diana.",
